config BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS
	bool "cpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  The int8 networks majestic's own engine runs on the CPU, in
	  /usr/share/majestic:
	  - person.qnet, the person detector its object detection runs on
	    cameras without an NPU (HiSilicon/Goke parts with the IVE motion
	    backend), with the thresholds of its three presets beside it in
	    person.json;
	  - drum.qnet, which reads the drums of a water, gas or electricity
	    meter for its meter reading.
	  134 KB together. MIT.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/cpu-models
